{
  "id": "594",
  "title": "My Internet is Slow Again",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-11-24",
  "synopsis": "Lili is trying to talk to her mom over a slow internet connection.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/875/5b6873449bf3f7ebb768aefe5cf4de7dac9e4183.mp3?1698350538",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "怎么又卡了\n\n丽丽：妈，听到了吗？妈？妈？唉！怎么又卡了！\n小何：怎么了？\n丽丽：我在网上和我妈说话。今天的网太慢了，老卡！\n小何：啊，是不是因为我在下电影？\n丽丽：有可能。\n小何：那我先不下电影了。\n丽丽：好！谢了！",
    "traditional": "怎麼又卡了\n\n麗麗：媽，聽到了嗎？媽？媽？唉！怎麼又卡了！\n小何：怎麼了？\n麗麗：我在網上和我媽說話。今天的網太慢了，老卡！\n小何：啊，是不是因為我在下電影？\n麗麗：有可能。\n小何：那我先不下電影了。\n麗麗：好！謝了！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "How Come It’s Slow Again?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：妈，听到了吗？妈？妈？唉！怎么又卡了！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：媽，聽到了嗎？媽？媽？唉！怎麼又卡了！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì mā tīng dào le ma mā mā ài zěn me yòu kǎ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Mom, can you hear me? Mom? Mom? Argh! How come it’s slow again!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：怎么了？",
      "traditional": "小何：怎麼了？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé zěn me le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: What’s wrong?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我在网上和我妈说话。今天的网太慢了，老卡！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我在網上和我媽說話。今天的網太慢了，老卡！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ zài wǎng shang hé wǒ mā shuō huà jīn tiān de wǎng tài màn le lǎo kǎ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I’m talking to my mom online. The internet connection is too slow today, it always gets stuck!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小何：啊，是不是因为我在下电影？",
      "traditional": "小何：啊，是不是因為我在下電影？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé a shì bu shì yīn wèi wǒ zài xià diàn yǐng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Ah, could it be because I’m downloading a movie?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：有可能。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：有可能。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì yǒu kě néng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Possibly."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小何：那我先不下电影了。",
      "traditional": "小何：那我先不下電影了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé nà wǒ xiān bú xià diàn yǐng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Then I won’t download the movie now."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：好！谢了！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：好！謝了！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hǎo xiè le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Good! Thanks!"
    }
  ],
